# v4.4 — the semantic-tier measurement. The .md record, the probes, and the trimmed
# production fixture the notice test anchors on. `pilot.jsonl` / `full.jsonl` /
# `affected_rows.json` stay OUT: the first two are regenerable measurement output and the
# third is the untrimmed production read (the trimmed, committed copy the test actually
# needs lives at test/fixtures/v4-4-affected-rows.json).
!experiments/v4-4/
experiments/v4-4/*
!experiments/v4-4/*.md
!experiments/v4-4/*.ts
!experiments/v4-4/*.mjs

# v4.5 — evidence a TEST reads. experiments/* is ignored, but test/resultNotices.test.ts
# reads this to prove every curated price-correction label joins against the real stored row.
# An evidence file the test needs but the repo does not carry makes that test unrunnable on a
# fresh clone, which is how a guard quietly stops guarding.
!experiments/v4-5/
experiments/v4-5/*
!experiments/v4-5/evidence/
!experiments/v4-5/evidence/*.json
